                             If $f(f(x))=1$, done (2 steps).\\n                 
                             -   ...\\n    -   So, we can precompute            
                             a boolean array `reducible[v][k]` for              
                             $v \\\\in [1, 800]$ and $k \\\\in [0,              
                             5]$.\\n        -   `reducible[1][k] =              
