                             is True:\\n            -   Compute                 
                             `count_lt(s, m)`.\\n            -   Add            
                             to `total`.\\n    -   Return `total %              
                             (10^9 + 7)`.\\n\\n### Implementation               
                             Details:\\n-   `reducible` table:\\n               
                             -   `f(v)`: bit count of $v$.\\n    -              
                             `reducible[1][k] = True` for all                   
